{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44497","headline":"诗三百三首 一九四 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一九四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹丘迥耸与云齐，空里五峰遥望低。\n鴈塔高排出青嶂，禅林古殿入虹蜺。\n风摇松叶赤城秀，雾吐中岩仙路迷。\n碧落千山万仞现，藤萝相接次连谿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}